  <entity00828497:DescriptionOfBalanceOfReceivablesRelatedPartyTransactionsOfDisclosureOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransactionsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2025dHY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_entity00828497_JvmEuropeMemberOfOtherRelatedPartiesMemberOfDisclosureOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">전기말 특수관계자 JVM EUROPE의 매출채권에 대한 대손충당금 5,271백만원을 계상하고 있습니다.</entity00828497:DescriptionOfBalanceOfReceivablesRelatedPartyTransactionsOfDisclosureOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransactionsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfItems>
  <entity00828497:DescriptionOfCircumstancesAffectingFairValue contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember" xml:lang="ko">당반기 중 연결회사의 금융자산과 금융부채 등의 공정가치에 영향을 미치는 사업환경 및 경제적인 환경의 유의적인 변동은 없습니다.</entity00828497:DescriptionOfCircumstancesAffectingFairValue>
  <entity00828497:DescriptionOfCircumstancesAffectingFairValue contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember" xml:lang="ko">당반기 중 회사의 금융자산과 금융부채 등의 공정가치에 영향을 미치는 사업환경 및경제적인 환경의 유의적인 변동은 없습니다.</entity00828497:DescriptionOfCircumstancesAffectingFairValue>
  <entity00828497:DescriptionOfContractLiabilitiesAndRefundLiabilitiesOfDisclosureOfContractLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContractLiabilitiesTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_ClassesOfCurrentAndNoncurrentValuesUsedForChangesInAssetAndLiabilityAxis_dart_AssetAndLiabilityClassifiedAsCurrentMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfLiabilitiesAxis_entity00828497_CustomerUndeliveredGoodsMemberOfClassesOfLiabilitiesDomainOfDisclosureOfContractLiabilitiesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사가 고객에게서 이미 받은 대가(또는 지급기일이 된 대가)에 상응하여 고객에게 이전해야 될 재화금액을 추정하여 계약부채로 인식하였습니다.</entity00828497:DescriptionOfContractLiabilitiesAndRefundLiabilitiesOfDisclosureOfContractLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContractLiabilitiesTableOfItems>
  <entity00828497:DescriptionOfContractLiabilitiesAndRefundLiabilitiesOfDisclosureOfContractLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContractLiabilitiesTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_ClassesOfCurrentAndNoncurrentValuesUsedForChangesInAssetAndLiabilityAxis_dart_AssetAndLiabilityClassifiedAsCurrentMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfLiabilitiesAxis_entity00828497_OtherRefundLiabilitiesMemberOfClassesOfLiabilitiesDomainOfDisclosureOfContractLiabilitiesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">콜리네이트연질캡슐(콜린알포세레이트) 임상재평가 실패 시 국민건강보험공단으로 납부하여야 할 금액 추정치에 해당합니다(주석 30참조).</entity00828497:DescriptionOfContractLiabilitiesAndRefundLiabilitiesOfDisclosureOfContractLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContractLiabilitiesTableOfItems>
  <entity00828497:DescriptionOfContractLiabilitiesAndRefundLiabilitiesOfDisclosureOfContractLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContractLiabilitiesTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_ClassesOfCurrentAndNoncurrentValuesUsedForChangesInAssetAndLiabilityAxis_dart_AssetAndLiabilityClassifiedAsCurrentMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfLiabilitiesAxis_entity00828497_UnearnedRevenueMemberOfClassesOfLiabilitiesDomainOfDisclosureOfContractLiabilitiesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사가 고객에게서 이미 받은 대가(또는 지급기일이 된 대가)에 상응하여 고객에게 재화나 용역을 이전하여야 하는 기업의 의무에 해당합니다.
연결회사가 고객에게 이미 받은 대가(또는 지급기일이 된 대가)를 조건에 따라 반환 해야할 의무로, 파트너사와 체결한 공급계약 관련 계약금을 환불부채로 인식하였습니다.</entity00828497:DescriptionOfContractLiabilitiesAndRefundLiabilitiesOfDisclosureOfContractLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContractLiabilitiesTableOfItems>
  <entity00828497:DescriptionOfContractLiabilitiesAndRefundLiabilitiesOfDisclosureOfContractLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContractLiabilitiesTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_ClassesOfCurrentAndNoncurrentValuesUsedForChangesInAssetAndLiabilityAxis_dart_AssetAndLiabilityClassifiedAsNoncurrentMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfLiabilitiesAxis_entity00828497_OtherRefundLiabilitiesMemberOfClassesOfLiabilitiesDomainOfDisclosureOfContractLiabilitiesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">콜리네이트연질캡슐(콜린알포세레이트) 임상재평가 실패 시 국민건강보험공단으로 납부하여야 할 금액 추정치에 해당합니다(주석 30참조).</entity00828497:DescriptionOfContractLiabilitiesAndRefundLiabilitiesOfDisclosureOfContractLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContractLiabilitiesTableOfItems>
